  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, and transformer aggregation (e.g., config_035) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests whether using transformer aggregation with concat fusion (instead of weighted fusion in config_035) could yield comparable or better performance. It clarifies the impact of fusion type while reusing high-performing components, balancing exploitation of known strengths and exploration of design choices. The expected cost is similar to config_035 (3.60 GPU hours), making it a cost-effective final test."
}

